@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam ArrowColor #35536C
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F3F6FA
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #F3F6FA
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F3F6FA
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F3F6FA
hide empty members
left to right direction
[*] --> ACTIVE : 认证成功 建立新会话
ACTIVE --> ACTIVE : 有效访问 更新活动时间
ACTIVE --> EXPIRED : 空闲或绝对时限到期
ACTIVE --> REVOKED : 退出 撤销 改密 停用
EXPIRED --> [*]
REVOKED --> [*]
note bottom of ACTIVE
只刷新活动时间
不延长绝对截止时间
end note

@enduml
